    {
      "sha": "15c7e59c05d14be214ded1f8fe703bfb0c14ffa0",
      "message": "favor placeholders over existentials when choosing SCC representatives\n\n... even when the existential has the least RegionVid.\n\nuniversal regions (of root universe) > placeholders > existentials\n\nThe previous behavior, that chooses the minimal RegionVid index, naturally prefers universal regions over others\nbecause they always have the least RegionVids, but there was no guranteed ordering between placeholders and existentials.",
      "files": [
        "compiler/rustc_borrowck/src/region_infer/mod.rs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sha": "08c8caa5244b91ab7bda3bbc383f66ae07f3cc93",
      "message": "convert all named regions in opaque types to nll vars\n\nDo it in typeck before entering region inference routines\nparticularly because we will no longer be able to convert placeholders.",
      "files": [
